# Runtime state
backend/.venv/
*.pyc
# Lease + spend state written by the LeaseManager / quota singletons at
# module import. These are per-host runtime artifacts and must never be
# committed; tests that exercise the singletons can otherwise leak fake
# principals (test-admin, user-a, ...) into the repo. Operators keep
# their real state under ~/.config/runner-dashboard.
config/leases.yml
config/principal_spend.yml
# Identity store (issue #944): live credentials must never be committed and the
# canonical location is ~/.config/runner-dashboard (DASHBOARD_IDENTITY_DIR).
# A committed default admin combined with dev-login into an unauthenticated
# admin hole; ship principals.yml.example instead.
config/principals.yml
config/tokens.yml
backend/data/

# Reject root-level scratch/debug files matching *_<number>.py
/*_[0-9]*.py
*.pyo
.claude/worktrees/
.agent_remediation_state.json

